From 1077f5679f8ab7c10d71269a2402c14e16c7c99a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BedrockOnLinux contributors <contributors@bedrock-on-linux.invalid>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 13:05:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] windows.storage: complete the single-file picker path flow

Keep single-file selection on the caller apartment through GetOpenFileNameW so Minecraft avoids the unstable Common Item Dialog and cross-apartment continuation paths.

Minecraft converts the WinAppSDK PickFileResult path through Windows.Storage.StorageFile.GetFileFromPathAsync. Provide that static method in the DLL already registered for StorageFile, return a completed typed async operation, and expose the selected file through IStorageFile and the IStorageItem Name and Path properties used by the game.
---
